IMPORT prelude
IMPORT daydate
IMPORT `sg-core`
IMPORT `sg-periods`
IMPORT `sg-definitions`
IMPORT `sg-groups`
IMPORT `sgd-compromise`
IMPORT `sgd-acquisition`

-- Tests for sgd-acquisition.l4: Companies Act 1967, ss 215, 215AA and 215AB.
-- Every expected value is written from the text (the comment beside it quotes or counts the words), never from the module's output.
-- A line "-- EXPECT <word>" above a #TRACE says what the trace must print: FULFILLED, BREACH, or RESIDUAL (an obligation still open).

§ `Fixtures: the counts of shares`

-- Fields, in order: shares in issue (treasury included), held as treasury, issued after the offer (not under an option), relevant treasury shares that ceased,
-- already held by the transferee at the date of the offer, counted shares whose holders approved.
sgd215_plain MEANS `s 215(1) share count` OF 1000, 0, 0, 0, 0, 900
sgd215_plain_short MEANS `s 215(1) share count` OF 1000, 0, 0, 0, 0, 899
sgd215_treasury MEANS `s 215(1) share count` OF 1000, 100, 0, 0, 0, 810
sgd215_treasury_short MEANS `s 215(1) share count` OF 1000, 100, 0, 0, 0, 809
sgd215_disregard MEANS `s 215(1) share count` OF 1000, 100, 50, 50, 100, 720
sgd215_disregard_short MEANS `s 215(1) share count` OF 1000, 100, 50, 50, 100, 630
sgd215_empty MEANS `s 215(1) share count` OF 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0

§ `Section 215(1): the base the 90% is counted against`

-- 1,000 shares in issue, 100 treasury, 50 issued after the offer (disregarded), 50 relevant treasury shares that ceased (disregarded): 1,000 - 100 - 50 - 50 = 800.
#ASSERT `s 215(1) the total number of the shares the 90% is counted against` `s 215(1) the transfer of all of the shares in the company` sgd215_disregard EQUALS 800
-- the class limb also leaves out the 100 shares the transferee already held at the date of the offer: 800 - 100 = 700
#ASSERT `s 215(1) the total number of the shares the 90% is counted against` `s 215(1) the transfer of all of the shares in a particular class in the company` sgd215_disregard EQUALS 700
#ASSERT `s 215(1) the number of shares already held by the transferee that are left out of the count` `s 215(1) the transfer of all of the shares in a particular class in the company` sgd215_disregard EQUALS 100
#ASSERT `s 215(1) the number of shares already held by the transferee that are left out of the count` `s 215(1) the transfer of all of the shares in the company` sgd215_disregard EQUALS 0
#ASSERT `s 215(1) the number of shares already held by the transferee that are left out of the count` `s 215(1) a transfer of some only of the shares` sgd215_disregard EQUALS 0
#ASSERT `s 215(1) the total number of the shares the 90% is counted against` `s 215(1) the transfer of all of the shares in the company` sgd215_plain EQUALS 1000
#ASSERT `s 215(1) the scheme or contract involves the transfer of all of the shares or of all of the shares in a particular class` `s 215(1) the transfer of all of the shares in the company`
#ASSERT `s 215(1) the scheme or contract involves the transfer of all of the shares or of all of the shares in a particular class` `s 215(1) the transfer of all of the shares in a particular class in the company`
#ASSERT NOT (`s 215(1) the scheme or contract involves the transfer of all of the shares or of all of the shares in a particular class` `s 215(1) a transfer of some only of the shares`)

§ `Section 215(1): the approval`

-- An offer made on 1 January 2026: 4 months after it ends on 1 May 2026 (P4); the window opens the day after the offer (P2).
#ASSERT `s 215(1) the scheme or contract has been approved by the holders of the requisite number of the shares` `s 215(1) the transfer of all of the shares in the company` sgd215_plain (Date 1 1 2026) (Date 1 5 2026) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 215(1) the scheme or contract has been approved by the holders of the requisite number of the shares` `s 215(1) the transfer of all of the shares in the company` sgd215_plain (Date 1 1 2026) (Date 2 5 2026) EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 215(1) the scheme or contract has been approved by the holders of the requisite number of the shares` `s 215(1) the transfer of all of the shares in the company` sgd215_plain (Date 1 1 2026) (Date 2 1 2026) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 215(1) the scheme or contract has been approved by the holders of the requisite number of the shares` `s 215(1) the transfer of all of the shares in the company` sgd215_plain (Date 1 1 2026) (Date 1 1 2026) EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- 900 of 1,000 is exactly 90%: "not less than 90%"; 899 is not
#ASSERT `s 215(1) the scheme or contract has been approved by the holders of the requisite number of the shares` `s 215(1) the transfer of all of the shares in the company` sgd215_plain_short (Date 1 1 2026) (Date 1 5 2026) EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- treasury shares are excluded from the total: 810 of 900 is 90%; 809 is not
#ASSERT `s 215(1) the scheme or contract has been approved by the holders of the requisite number of the shares` `s 215(1) the transfer of all of the shares in the company` sgd215_treasury (Date 1 1 2026) (Date 1 5 2026) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 215(1) the scheme or contract has been approved by the holders of the requisite number of the shares` `s 215(1) the transfer of all of the shares in the company` sgd215_treasury_short (Date 1 1 2026) (Date 1 5 2026) EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- disregarded shares: base 800, 720 is 90%
#ASSERT `s 215(1) the scheme or contract has been approved by the holders of the requisite number of the shares` `s 215(1) the transfer of all of the shares in the company` sgd215_disregard (Date 1 1 2026) (Date 1 5 2026) EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- 630 approving: class limb (base 700) reaches 90%, the all-shares limb (base 800) does not (fork F-215-2)
#ASSERT `s 215(1) the scheme or contract has been approved by the holders of the requisite number of the shares` `s 215(1) the transfer of all of the shares in a particular class in the company` sgd215_disregard_short (Date 1 1 2026) (Date 1 5 2026) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 215(1) the scheme or contract has been approved by the holders of the requisite number of the shares` `s 215(1) the transfer of all of the shares in the company` sgd215_disregard_short (Date 1 1 2026) (Date 1 5 2026) EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- a transfer of some only of the shares is outside the subsection's "where"
#ASSERT `s 215(1) the scheme or contract has been approved by the holders of the requisite number of the shares` `s 215(1) a transfer of some only of the shares` sgd215_plain (Date 1 1 2026) (Date 1 5 2026) EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- nothing in issue: no 90% of nothing
#ASSERT `s 215(1) the scheme or contract has been approved by the holders of the requisite number of the shares` `s 215(1) the transfer of all of the shares in the company` sgd215_empty (Date 1 1 2026) (Date 1 5 2026) EQUALS JUST FALSE

§ `Section 215(1): the notice to the dissenting shareholder`

-- Approved on 1 May 2026: 2 months after ends on 1 July 2026. Arguments: the approval is as (1) requires, the day approved, the day of the notice, dissenting, in the prescribed manner.
#ASSERT `s 215(1) the transferee may give notice to the dissenting shareholder that it desires to acquire the shares` TRUE (Date 1 5 2026) (Date 1 7 2026) TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 215(1) the transferee may give notice to the dissenting shareholder that it desires to acquire the shares` TRUE (Date 1 5 2026) (Date 2 5 2026) TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 215(1) the transferee may give notice to the dissenting shareholder that it desires to acquire the shares` TRUE (Date 1 5 2026) (Date 2 7 2026) TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 215(1) the transferee may give notice to the dissenting shareholder that it desires to acquire the shares` TRUE (Date 1 5 2026) (Date 1 5 2026) TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 215(1) the transferee may give notice to the dissenting shareholder that it desires to acquire the shares` FALSE (Date 1 5 2026) (Date 1 6 2026) TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- not a dissenting shareholder: outside the grant
#ASSERT `s 215(1) the transferee may give notice to the dissenting shareholder that it desires to acquire the shares` TRUE (Date 1 5 2026) (Date 1 6 2026) FALSE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
-- not in the prescribed manner: points outside the sources
#ASSERT `s 215(1) the transferee may give notice to the dissenting shareholder that it desires to acquire the shares` TRUE (Date 1 5 2026) (Date 1 6 2026) TRUE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
-- the period is tested before the person: a late notice to a person who is not dissenting is JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 215(1) the transferee may give notice to the dissenting shareholder that it desires to acquire the shares` TRUE (Date 1 5 2026) (Date 2 7 2026) FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE

§ `Section 215(1): one month, 14 days, the later of the two`

-- A notice given on 31 January 2026: one month later is 28 February 2026 (P4; 2026 is not a leap year). A statement supplied on 20 February 2026: 14 days later is 6 March 2026.
#ASSERT `s 215(1) the last day of one month from the date on which the notice was given` (Date 31 1 2026) EQUALS (Date 28 2 2026)
#ASSERT `s 215(1) the last day of 14 days of a statement being supplied` (Date 20 2 2026) EQUALS (Date 6 3 2026)
#ASSERT `s 215(1) the last day of the later of the one month and the 14 days` (Date 31 1 2026) NOTHING EQUALS (Date 28 2 2026)
#ASSERT `s 215(1) the last day of the later of the one month and the 14 days` (Date 31 1 2026) (JUST (Date 20 2 2026)) EQUALS (Date 6 3 2026)
-- a statement supplied on 1 February 2026: 14 days later is 15 February 2026, earlier than 28 February
#ASSERT `s 215(1) the last day of the later of the one month and the 14 days` (Date 31 1 2026) (JUST (Date 1 2 2026)) EQUALS (Date 28 2 2026)
-- the dissenting shareholder's application (no statement): in time up to and including 28 February
#ASSERT `s 215(1) the dissenting shareholder's application to the Court is within the time subsection (1) allows` (Date 31 1 2026) NOTHING (Date 28 2 2026) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 215(1) the dissenting shareholder's application to the Court is within the time subsection (1) allows` (Date 31 1 2026) NOTHING (Date 1 3 2026) EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 215(1) the dissenting shareholder's application to the Court is within the time subsection (1) allows` (Date 31 1 2026) (JUST (Date 20 2 2026)) (Date 6 3 2026) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 215(1) the dissenting shareholder's application to the Court is within the time subsection (1) allows` (Date 31 1 2026) (JUST (Date 20 2 2026)) (Date 7 3 2026) EQUALS JUST FALSE

§ `Section 215(1): the Court's order, the entitlement, the terms`

-- Arguments of the Court's power: the shareholder has applied, the application is in time, the Court thinks fit.
#ASSERT `s 215(1) the Court may order that the transferee is not entitled and bound to acquire the shares` FALSE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 215(1) the Court may order that the transferee is not entitled and bound to acquire the shares` TRUE FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 215(1) the Court may order that the transferee is not entitled and bound to acquire the shares` TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 215(1) the Court may order that the transferee is not entitled and bound to acquire the shares` TRUE TRUE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
-- Arguments of the entitlement: the notice was given, the application was in time, the Court thought fit to order otherwise.
#ASSERT `s 215(1) the transferee is entitled and bound to acquire the dissenting shareholder's shares` FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 215(1) the transferee is entitled and bound to acquire the dissenting shareholder's shares` TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 215(1) the transferee is entitled and bound to acquire the dissenting shareholder's shares` TRUE TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 215(1) the transferee is entitled and bound to acquire the dissenting shareholder's shares` TRUE FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 215(1) the transferee is entitled and bound to acquire the dissenting shareholder's shares` TRUE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- the terms: one set of terms; alternatives elected in time; alternatives and no election in time
#ASSERT `s 215(1) the terms on which the transferee must acquire the dissenting shareholder's shares` FALSE FALSE EQUALS `s 215(1) the terms on which the shares of the approving shareholders are to be transferred to the transferee`
#ASSERT `s 215(1) the terms on which the transferee must acquire the dissenting shareholder's shares` FALSE TRUE EQUALS `s 215(1) the terms on which the shares of the approving shareholders are to be transferred to the transferee`
#ASSERT `s 215(1) the terms on which the transferee must acquire the dissenting shareholder's shares` TRUE TRUE EQUALS `s 215(1A) the terms the dissenting shareholder has elected`
#ASSERT `s 215(1) the terms on which the transferee must acquire the dissenting shareholder's shares` TRUE FALSE EQUALS `s 215(1B) the terms the offer stated are to apply where the dissenting shareholder fails to elect in time`

§ `Section 215(1A) and (1B): alternative terms`

-- Arguments of (1A): alternative terms were offered, the day of the notice, the day of the statement (if any), the day the shareholder elected.
#ASSERT `s 215(1A) the dissenting shareholder is entitled to elect which of the terms the shareholder prefers` FALSE (Date 31 1 2026) NOTHING (Date 1 2 2026) EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 215(1A) the dissenting shareholder is entitled to elect which of the terms the shareholder prefers` TRUE (Date 31 1 2026) NOTHING (Date 28 2 2026) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 215(1A) the dissenting shareholder is entitled to elect which of the terms the shareholder prefers` TRUE (Date 31 1 2026) NOTHING (Date 1 3 2026) EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 215(1A) the dissenting shareholder is entitled to elect which of the terms the shareholder prefers` TRUE (Date 31 1 2026) (JUST (Date 20 2 2026)) (Date 6 3 2026) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 215(1A) the dissenting shareholder is entitled to elect which of the terms the shareholder prefers` TRUE (Date 31 1 2026) (JUST (Date 20 2 2026)) (Date 7 3 2026) EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- (1B): the offer contains alternative terms, the offer states which applies on a failure to elect
#ASSERT `s 215(1B) the transferee has stated which of the terms is to apply on a failure to elect` FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 215(1B) the transferee has stated which of the terms is to apply on a failure to elect` TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 215(1B) the transferee has stated which of the terms is to apply on a failure to elect` TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE

§ `Section 215(1C) to (1E): which shares are counted`

-- (1C)(a): issued after the date of the offer; issued pursuant to an option or convertible security
#ASSERT `s 215(1C)(a) the shares are to be disregarded` FALSE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 215(1C)(a) the shares are to be disregarded` TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 215(1C)(a) the shares are to be disregarded` TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- (1D): held as treasury shares on the date of the offer; became treasury shares after the offer; before the date specified in the terms
#ASSERT `s 215(1D) the shares are relevant treasury shares` TRUE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 215(1D) the shares are relevant treasury shares` FALSE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 215(1D) the shares are relevant treasury shares` FALSE TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 215(1D) the shares are relevant treasury shares` FALSE FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 215(1D) the shares are relevant treasury shares` FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- (1C)(b): relevant treasury shares; they cease to be held as treasury shares after the date of the offer
#ASSERT `s 215(1C)(b) the shares are to be disregarded` TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 215(1C)(b) the shares are to be disregarded` TRUE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 215(1C)(b) the shares are to be disregarded` FALSE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
-- (1E): the requisite percentage was reached; a later issue pursuant to an option; the matter
#ASSERT `s 215(1E) the subsequent issue of shares affects the matter` TRUE TRUE `s 215(1E)(a) the approval` EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 215(1E) the subsequent issue of shares affects the matter` TRUE TRUE `s 215(1E)(b) the transferee's right to give a notice mentioned in subsection (1) after the approval` EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 215(1E) the subsequent issue of shares affects the matter` TRUE TRUE `s 215(1E)(c) the validity of any such notice` EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 215(1E) the subsequent issue of shares affects the matter` TRUE TRUE `s 215(1E) some other matter` EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 215(1E) the subsequent issue of shares affects the matter` FALSE TRUE `s 215(1E)(a) the approval` EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 215(1E) the subsequent issue of shares affects the matter` TRUE FALSE `s 215(1E)(a) the approval` EQUALS NOTHING

§ `Section 215(2): the statement of names and addresses`

-- Notice given on 10 March 2026: one month from it ends on 10 April 2026. Arguments: the notice was given, the day of it, the day the written demand was served.
#ASSERT `s 215(2) the dissenting shareholder is entitled to require the transferor company to supply the statement` FALSE (Date 10 3 2026) (Date 20 3 2026) EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 215(2) the dissenting shareholder is entitled to require the transferor company to supply the statement` TRUE (Date 10 3 2026) (Date 10 4 2026) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 215(2) the dissenting shareholder is entitled to require the transferor company to supply the statement` TRUE (Date 10 3 2026) (Date 11 4 2026) EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 215(2) the dissenting shareholder is entitled to require the transferor company to supply the statement` TRUE (Date 10 3 2026) (Date 10 3 2026) EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- the bar: the notice was given, a statement was demanded, the day it was posted (if it was), the day asked about. Posted 10 March: 14 days after ends 24 March.
#ASSERT `s 215(2) the transferee is not yet entitled or bound to acquire the shares` FALSE TRUE (JUST (Date 10 3 2026)) (Date 20 3 2026) EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 215(2) the transferee is not yet entitled or bound to acquire the shares` TRUE FALSE NOTHING (Date 20 3 2026) EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 215(2) the transferee is not yet entitled or bound to acquire the shares` TRUE TRUE NOTHING (Date 20 3 2026) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 215(2) the transferee is not yet entitled or bound to acquire the shares` TRUE TRUE (JUST (Date 10 3 2026)) (Date 24 3 2026) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 215(2) the transferee is not yet entitled or bound to acquire the shares` TRUE TRUE (JUST (Date 10 3 2026)) (Date 25 3 2026) EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 215(2) the transferee is not yet entitled or bound to acquire the shares` TRUE TRUE (JUST (Date 10 3 2026)) (Date 10 3 2026) EQUALS JUST TRUE

§ `Section 215(3) and (3A): the 90% reached by the transfers`

-- Fields, in order: total shares (treasury included), transferred to the transferee or its nominee, other shares held by the transferee at the date of the transfer, treasury shares held by the transferor company.
-- 800 transferred + 50 held + 50 treasury = 900 of 1,000: 90%.
#ASSERT `s 215(3A) the number of the treasury shares treated as having been acquired by the transferee` (`s 215(3) share count` OF 1000, 800, 50, 50) FALSE EQUALS 50
#ASSERT `s 215(3A) the number of the treasury shares treated as having been acquired by the transferee` (`s 215(3) share count` OF 1000, 800, 50, 50) TRUE EQUALS 0
#ASSERT `s 215(3) the number of shares held by the transferee after the transfer, the treasury shares treated as acquired` (`s 215(3) share count` OF 1000, 800, 50, 50) FALSE EQUALS 900
#ASSERT `s 215(3) the number of shares held by the transferee after the transfer, the treasury shares treated as acquired` (`s 215(3) share count` OF 1000, 800, 50, 50) TRUE EQUALS 850
#ASSERT `s 215(3) the shares transferred, together with the other shares held by the transferee, comprise or include 90%` (`s 215(3) share count` OF 1000, 800, 50, 50) FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- measured against a class the treasury shares are not added: 850 of 1,000 is not 90% (fork F-215-10)
#ASSERT `s 215(3) the shares transferred, together with the other shares held by the transferee, comprise or include 90%` (`s 215(3) share count` OF 1000, 800, 50, 50) TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 215(3) the shares transferred, together with the other shares held by the transferee, comprise or include 90%` (`s 215(3) share count` OF 1000, 800, 50, 49) FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 215(3) the shares transferred, together with the other shares held by the transferee, comprise or include 90%` (`s 215(3) share count` OF 0, 0, 0, 0) FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- (3)(a): the 90% was reached; the transferee has already complied on a previous transfer
#ASSERT `s 215(3)(a) the transferee must give notice of that fact to the holders of the remaining shares who have not assented` FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 215(3)(a) the transferee must give notice of that fact to the holders of the remaining shares who have not assented` TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 215(3)(a) the transferee must give notice of that fact to the holders of the remaining shares who have not assented` TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- a transfer on 31 January 2026: one month from it ends on 28 February 2026 (P4)
#ASSERT `s 215(3)(a) the notice was given within one month from the date of the transfer` (Date 31 1 2026) (Date 28 2 2026) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 215(3)(a) the notice was given within one month from the date of the transfer` (Date 31 1 2026) (Date 1 3 2026) EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 215(3)(a) the notice was given within one month from the date of the transfer` (Date 15 3 2026) (Date 15 4 2026) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 215(3)(a) the notice was given within one month from the date of the transfer` (Date 15 3 2026) (Date 16 4 2026) EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 215(3)(a) the number of days from the start day to the last day for the notice` (Date 31 1 2026) (Date 31 1 2026) EQUALS 28
-- (3)(b): the 90% was reached, the holder has not assented, the day of the notice to the holder (if any), the day the holder required acquisition. Notice 10 March: 3 months ends 10 June.
#ASSERT `s 215(3)(b) the holder may require the transferee to acquire the shares in question` FALSE TRUE (JUST (Date 10 3 2026)) (Date 20 3 2026) EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 215(3)(b) the holder may require the transferee to acquire the shares in question` TRUE FALSE (JUST (Date 10 3 2026)) (Date 20 3 2026) EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 215(3)(b) the holder may require the transferee to acquire the shares in question` TRUE TRUE NOTHING (Date 20 3 2026) EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 215(3)(b) the holder may require the transferee to acquire the shares in question` TRUE TRUE (JUST (Date 10 3 2026)) (Date 10 6 2026) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 215(3)(b) the holder may require the transferee to acquire the shares in question` TRUE TRUE (JUST (Date 10 3 2026)) (Date 11 6 2026) EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- (3): once the shareholder gives notice under (b), entitled and bound; the terms
#ASSERT `s 215(3) the transferee is entitled and bound to acquire the shares` TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 215(3) the transferee is entitled and bound to acquire the shares` FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 215(3) the terms on which the transferee must acquire the shares` TRUE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 215(3) the terms on which the transferee must acquire the shares` FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST `s 215(3) such other terms as the Court thinks fit to order`
#ASSERT `s 215(3) the terms on which the transferee must acquire the shares` TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST `s 215(3) such other terms as are agreed`
#ASSERT `s 215(3) the terms on which the transferee must acquire the shares` FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST `s 215(3) the terms on which under the scheme or contract the shares of the approving shareholders were transferred to the transferee`

§ `Section 215(4): the transmission and payment`

-- Arguments: a notice has been given under (1); the Court has ordered to the contrary.
#ASSERT `s 215(4) the transferee must transmit a copy of the notice and pay, allot or transfer the consideration to the transferor company` TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 215(4) the transferee must transmit a copy of the notice and pay, allot or transfer the consideration to the transferor company` TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 215(4) the transferee must transmit a copy of the notice and pay, allot or transfer the consideration to the transferor company` FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- Arguments: the day of the notice, the day of the statement (if any), an application is then pending, the day it was disposed of (if it has been).
-- Notice 10 March 2026: one month ends 10 April; the duty is due from 11 April.
#ASSERT `s 215(4) the first day on which the transferee must act` (Date 10 3 2026) NOTHING FALSE NOTHING EQUALS JUST (Date 11 4 2026)
-- a statement supplied on 5 April 2026: 14 days end on 19 April, later than 10 April: due from 20 April
#ASSERT `s 215(4) the first day on which the transferee must act` (Date 10 3 2026) (JUST (Date 5 4 2026)) FALSE NOTHING EQUALS JUST (Date 20 4 2026)
-- an application still pending: no day yet
#ASSERT `s 215(4) the first day on which the transferee must act` (Date 10 3 2026) NOTHING TRUE NOTHING EQUALS NOTHING
-- disposed of on 25 April 2026, after the 19 April end of the 14 days: due from 26 April
#ASSERT `s 215(4) the first day on which the transferee must act` (Date 10 3 2026) (JUST (Date 5 4 2026)) TRUE (JUST (Date 25 4 2026)) EQUALS JUST (Date 26 4 2026)
-- disposed of on 15 April 2026, before the 19 April end: due from 20 April
#ASSERT `s 215(4) the first day on which the transferee must act` (Date 10 3 2026) (JUST (Date 5 4 2026)) TRUE (JUST (Date 15 4 2026)) EQUALS JUST (Date 20 4 2026)
-- disposed of on 5 April 2026, before the 10 April end of the month: due from 11 April
#ASSERT `s 215(4) the first day on which the transferee must act` (Date 10 3 2026) NOTHING TRUE (JUST (Date 5 4 2026)) EQUALS JUST (Date 11 4 2026)

§ `Section 215(5) to (7): the trust, the Official Receiver`

#ASSERT `s 215(5) the transferor company has paid the sums into a separate bank account` FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 215(5) the transferor company has paid the sums into a separate bank account` FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 215(5) the transferor company has paid the sums into a separate bank account` TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 215(5) the transferor company has paid the sums into a separate bank account` TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- (6): received on 1 March 2020: the last day of the 2 years is 1 March 2022; of the 10 years, 1 March 2030 (P1, P4)
#ASSERT `s 215(6) the transfer to the Official Receiver is within the time the subsection allows` TRUE (Date 1 3 2020) (Date 1 3 2022) EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 215(6) the transfer to the Official Receiver is within the time the subsection allows` TRUE (Date 1 3 2020) (Date 2 3 2022) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 215(6) the transfer to the Official Receiver is within the time the subsection allows` TRUE (Date 1 3 2020) (Date 1 3 2030) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 215(6) the transfer to the Official Receiver is within the time the subsection allows` TRUE (Date 1 3 2020) (Date 2 3 2030) EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 215(6) the transfer to the Official Receiver is within the time the subsection allows` FALSE (Date 1 3 2020) (Date 2 3 2025) EQUALS JUST FALSE
